    "limits": [
      "Reported breeding months from literature, not detection-corrected durations; no sampling-month denominator available. Zero month means not reported, not confirmed nonbreeding.",
      "Same publication+municipality comparison within Leptodactylidae reduces site/study and family confounding but may pool different ponds, years or survey schedules. Coordinate matching is approximate and some coordinates reconstructed by original authors.",
      "Repeated species across studies and genus-specific trait conservatism violate simple independence. Bootstrap intervals descriptive, not phylogenetically corrected.",
      "Ground excluded in strict E; actual accessible nest area/persistence unknown. No butterfly observation or fertilization endpoint."
