  "decision": "No generalizable longer reported breeding season for exposed foam types. Original and no-ground comparisons are weak positive with intervals spanning zero; same-genus result reverses with sparse exposed species. Retain both; no trait-specific breeding-duration parameter for butterfly model. Coordinate format not parsed (0 valid pairs), so coordinate/climate matching unverified. No actual foam lifetime, exposed surface area, butterfly mating, or fertility data."
